@startuml
title RuleSphere - Decision Draft Lifecycle (UC-05..09)
hide empty description
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #EAF6F8
skinparam stateBorderColor #177E8D
skinparam ArrowColor #527183

' Classifier: DecisionVersion (COMET State Dependent Control)
' Target Object: DecisionVersion instance within a Workspace

state "Editing draft" as Editing {
  Editing : entry / markDraftMutable()
  Editing : editGraph / save nodes and dependencies
  Editing : editSchema / version input and output contracts
  Editing : configureFallback / save typed fallback
}

state "Validating graph and contracts" as Validating {
  Validating : entry / runDAGValidation(); runContractCheck()
}

state "Validation failed" as Invalid {
  Invalid : entry / recordValidationErrors()
}

state "Validated draft" as Valid {
  Valid : entry / bindValidationStamp(currentRevision)
  Valid : submitRelease [authorized] / create release candidate (diagram 02)
}

state "Running sandbox" as Sandbox {
  Sandbox : entry / executeDraftSnapshot()
}

state "Sandbox completed" as Tested {
  Tested : entry / recordSimulationSuccess()
  Tested : submitRelease [authorized] / create release candidate (diagram 02)
}

state "Sandbox failed" as TestFailed {
  TestFailed : entry / recordSimulationDiagnostics()
}

' F-04: Initial pseudo-state transition has no trigger or guard per UML 2.5.1
[*] --> Editing : / initDraftRevision()

Editing --> Validating : validate
Validating --> Invalid : validationCompleted [errors detected]\n/ expose cycles and contract errors
Validating --> Valid : validationCompleted [all checks pass]
Invalid --> Editing : edit / invalidatePreviousValidation()
Invalid --> Validating : revalidate
Valid --> Editing : edit / invalidatePreviousValidation()
Valid --> Sandbox : executeSandbox [executable draft valid]
Sandbox --> Tested : executionSucceeded / return result and trace
Sandbox --> TestFailed : executionFailed / return diagnostics
TestFailed --> Sandbox : retry [same valid revision]
TestFailed --> Editing : edit / invalidatePreviousValidation()
Tested --> Sandbox : executeSandbox [new test input]
Tested --> Editing : edit / invalidatePreviousValidation()

note right of Editing
  Nodes: Decision Table, Decision Tree,
  Scripted Expression, Rule Set.
  The draft and release candidate are separate objects.
  Submitting does not terminate the draft lifecycle.
end note

note bottom of Valid
  Validation tracks a specific draft revision.
  Sandbox success is an authoring aid; submitting release
  can occur from Validated or Tested state.
end note

legend bottom
  Transition: event [guard] / effect | entry / action
  Classifier: DecisionVersion (COMET State-Dependent Object)
  Conforms to UML 2.5.1 initial transition semantics (OMG UMLR-803).
endlegend
@enduml
